At year 1, who are the adults?
Initially, no one is an adult.
At year 1, Alien 1 becomes an adult.
Does Alien 1 receive stones from existing adults?
The problem statement says: "When someone becomes an adult ... every adult who has at least one stone gives exactly one stone ... to the alien who has just become an adult."
This implies that at the moment Alien 1 becomes an adult, the set of adults consists of those who have already become adults.
Since Alien 1 is the *first* to become an adult (at year 1), there are no other adults yet. So Alien 1 receives 0 stones.
Wait, let's look at the sample explanation carefully.
