Available candidates: 7, 10.
Pick smallest valid $b$, which is 7. Pair (3, 7).
Remaining: 4, 10.
Smallest is 4. Need $b \ge 8$.
Available candidates: 10.
Pick 10. Pair (4, 10).
Total pairs: 3. This matches sample output 1.

