The value of $P_i$ is some $x \in \{1, \ldots, N\} \setminus S_{i+1, N}$.

Let's rephrase. We are summing over all permutations.
Consider the contribution of a specific number $x \in \{1, \ldots, N\}$ to the total sum.
Suppose $x$ is placed at position $i$. Then its contribution is $x \cdot 10^{\sum_{j=i+1}^N D_{P_j}}$.
